          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.030:block:2",
          "start": 202
        },
        "quote": "(2) Discharge stormwater runoff to a downstream stormwater drainage system that may not be able to safely control or could be damaged by the stormwater runoff from the project; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.030:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.35.030 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "f157becd-56f6-512f-ac10-41c319f1bb66",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 642,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.030:block:3",
          "start": 382
        },
        "quote": "(3) Be located in, or will discharge stormwater runoff to, an area or stream having an engineering study which indicates a greater need for control of stormwater runoff in order to alleviate or avoid waterway pollution, erosion, flood, or drainage problems; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.030:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.35.030 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "efc39854-e442-59f7-be36-3a64186edd48",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 957,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.030:block:4",
          "start": 643
        },
        "quote": "(4) Be located in, or discharge stormwater runoff to, an area or water body where erosion, flooding, or stormwater drainage problems are known to exist, whether said problems are documented or not, and where the Director has reason to believe the project, once constructed, may further exacerbate such problems; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.030:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.35.030 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "171ded5d-2a47-5927-abcd-44e62ce02cee",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
