          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.030:block:6",
          "start": 1099
        },
        "quote": "(6) Be located on an existing brownfield or on a property known to have existing pollutants in the soil or on the ground that, if discharged from the property in stormwater runoff or groundwater, may cause harm to the general public or the environment; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.35.030:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
